{"id":"vod_sn_39270","vodId":"39270","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"史上最强弟子兼一 OVA","name_cn":"史上最强弟子兼一 OVA","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/b9dd0e02cbe564774097b99f738c4f9b.jpg"},"summary":"由日本漫画家松江名俊原作的「史上最强弟子兼一」，曾于2006年10至2007年9月间推出过共计50集的电视动画版。如今，该作的全新动画「史上最强弟子兼一 暗的袭击」将在今年4月于TOKYO MX电视台开始播送。　　「史上最强弟子兼一 暗的袭击」是由原作漫画单行本特别版同捆的OVA动画系列作为蓝本，并在其基础上进行再次剪辑播出，新作会以第46卷特别版同捆OVA“新的刺客”作为故事起点。另外，此番动画的制作人员和配音演员阵会延续原OVA动画中的阵容，监督依然是石踊宏，而人气声优关智一、钉宫理惠、能登麻美子等人已经确定加盟出演。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:08:46","playable":true,"episodeCount":11,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gNu9DKxCmp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FwaMFAcfZq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/k69P7kWcdd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/s0ycTYK1471/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BHEB8cZyJ11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WtYMKCPLh91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dDLFQcfYHp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wtMecKiHP21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VLnqDh6NNf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/67nBHJrXwS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uiJeKJC1HC1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:48.384Z"}